      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "今天我们聊一个特别实用的东西，MCP。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p1-cover-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "全称是 Model Context Protocol，模型上下文协议。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p1-cover-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "简单说，就是给 AI 应用装一个通用 USB 接口。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p1-cover-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "让我们开始吧。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p1-cover-s3.mp3"
        }
      ],
