    {
      "id": "p2-duo-positioning",
      "eyebrow": "定位",
      "title": "MCP解决什么问题？",
      "content": {
        "kind": "duo",
        "left": {
          "title": "没有MCP",
          "tag": "之前",
          "body": "每个 AI 助手要为**每个数据源**单独写适配代码\n\nGitHub、Drive、PostgreSQL…**重复造轮子**"
        },
        "right": {
          "title": "有了MCP",
          "tag": "现在",
          "body": "**统一标准接口**\n\nAI助手 ↔ MCP服务器 ↔ 各种数据源\n\n一次开发，到处复用"
        }
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "先看 MCP 解决什么问题。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p2-duo-positioning-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "之前，每个 AI 助手要为每个数据源单独写适配代码。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p2-duo-positioning-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "GitHub、Drive、PostgreSQL，每接入一个就要重新来过，重复造轮子。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p2-duo-positioning-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "MCP 就像是给 AI 应用装了一个通用 USB 接口。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p2-duo-positioning-s3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "只要服务器遵循这个标准，任何 AI 客户端都能即插即用。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p2-duo-positioning-s4.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "一次开发，到处复用。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p2-duo-positioning-s5.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "fragments": [
        {
          "effect": "fade",
          "target": "left",
          "with_sentence": 2
        },
        {
          "effect": "pop",
          "target": "right",
          "with_sentence": 4
        }
      ],
      "checkpoint": {
        "question": "用一句话解释 MCP 类比成什么接口？",
        "hint": "想一想电脑连接外部设备的标准接口",
        "pass_rule": "回答包含\"USB接口\"或\"通用标准接口\""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p3-formula-architecture",
      "eyebrow": "架构",
      "title": "MCP 怎么工作？",
      "content": {
        "kind": "formula",
        "items": [
          "客户端（AI 应用）",
          "服务器（提供能力）",
          "工具（可调用函数）",
          "资源（数据）",
          "提示词（预定义模板）",
          "JSON-RPC 2.0 通信",
          "双向通知机制"
        ],
        "conclusion": "客户端-服务器架构 · 统一消息格式"
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "那 MCP 怎么工作呢？",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p3-formula-architecture-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "它采用客户端-服务器架构。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p3-formula-architecture-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "客户端就是 AI 应用，比如桌面 IDE。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p3-formula-architecture-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "服务器则提供工具、资源和提示词这三大能力。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p3-formula-architecture-s3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "工具就是可调用的函数。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p3-formula-architecture-s4.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "资源是各种数据，像文件、消息之类的。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p3-formula-architecture-s5.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "提示词是预定义的模板。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p3-formula-architecture-s6.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "它们之间用 JSON-RPC 2.0 格式通信。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p3-formula-architecture-s7.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "支持双向通知，服务器能主动推送消息。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p3-formula-architecture-s8.mp3"
        }
      ],
