    {
      "id": "p4-duo-transport",
      "eyebrow": "传输方式",
      "title": "本地还是远程？",
      "content": {
        "kind": "duo",
        "left": {
          "title": "stdio 标准输入输出",
          "tag": "本地进程",
          "body": "适用于**本地运行**的服务器\n\n通过标准输入输出通信\n\n简单、可靠、无需网络"
        },
        "right": {
          "title": "SSE 服务端推送事件",
          "tag": "远程连接",
          "body": "适用于**远程服务器**\n\n通过 HTTP 持久连接\n\n支持跨机器、云端部署"
        }
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "MCP 支持两种传输方式。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p4-duo-transport-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "本地服务器用 stdio，就是标准输入输出。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p4-duo-transport-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "适合在本地运行的服务器，简单可靠，不需要网络。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p4-duo-transport-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "远程服务器用 SSE，服务端推送事件。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p4-duo-transport-s3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "通过 HTTP 持久连接，支持跨机器部署到云端。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p4-duo-transport-s4.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "这两种方式底层都是 JSON-RPC 消息。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p4-duo-transport-s5.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "fragments": [
